# MindWire runtime data (never commit)
spirrow-mindwire-data/

# Per-turn dispatcher-written spec pin (SPEC-2026-08-11-design-spec-delivery D-5).
# `.mindwire/pin` is written into the working tree by the loop dispatcher, is not
# tracked, and must not be committed. Keeping the whole `.mindwire/` directory
# ignored means the pin never appears in `git status --porcelain` and can never
# ride into a commit by accident.
.mindwire/

# Visual Studio (local-only IDE state)
.vs/
